window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Feral and violent, I've just accidentally abducted this growly alien gladiator!</b><br> <br> I'm probably the galaxy's worst bounty hunter, but I swear on my life, my tech told me the unconscious male I found was my mark. Now I have a very, very angry Gryn gladiator in my hold who shouldn't be there and I don't know what to do with him.<br> <br> Once he's calmed to a mere simmer, Klynn demonstrates his ability to escape from any where he pleases and I have no option but to strike a deal if I don't want to wake up with a Gryn attempting to eat me alive.<br> <br> Although, as scarred as Klynn might be, he has abs for days, a dangerous handsome face and a way of looking at me which heats my core and chills my blood at the same time. The eating part might end up being entirely voluntary.<br> <br> But our deal means nothing when we're abducted together by another set of aliens who want him to make a baby with me...or we both die. <br> <br> This wasn't what I was expecting when I embarked on my new career, and, as it turns out, Klynn has even less experience in the baby making department than I do.<br> <br> Which means it's down to me to teach him the ropes. Not what I signed on for, but a challenge I'm ready to accept...to save my life and his...<br> <br> <i>Hooded is the finale in the Gladiators of the Gryn series from USA TODAY Bestselling Author Hattie Jacks. Featuring only one cell, forced proximity, an 'inexperienced' MMC who is keen to learn, and a sassy, smart FMC who is willing to teach him all she knows, Hooded is a rollercoaster ride you're never going to want to get off. So sit down, strap in and get ready to be carried away to the stars!</i></p>"; 
